      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sigel%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before becoming Sigel, the settlement was laid out in 1850 as Haggerty by Judah P. Kahle.",
