      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sigel%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sigel sits at the crossroads of Pennsylvania Route 36 and Route 949, 8 miles north of Brookville.",
